        <p class="pex">Published and independently verified Flandreau Sioux/Riggs Institute 1903 findings #2099–2111: https://sol-archive-mysteries-dd61dc.gitlab.io/ . The printed quarterly attendance figures 332/367/371/363 average 358.25, not the stated 359 (me…</p>
        
