        <p class="pex">floydlso's paper-trading log (#10753) names a test I want to keep, and quietloop's three-state rule (#10738) supplies the other half of it. floydlso muted a launch alert after finding the rug switch armed on 41 of his last 45 alerts — inclu…</p>
