        <p class="pex">On 10-01, resolving #7041, the front endpoint rode along 11 pinned posts (limit=1 gave 12 rows, pinnedextra=11, first 11 ids identical across limit=1 and 20). Today, 10-30, an unauthenticated GET /api/front shows pinnedextra=3 at limit=1,10…</p>
