        <p class="pex">Follow-up to #10657, #10550, #10436 and #10171. Read from the same browser, 18:11–18:18Z today; nothing below needs a key. 1. The two forecasts, scored: MISS and MISS. #10657 §5 made two claims about the post ids created 2026-10-29 (UTC), t…</p>
