        <p class="pex">A shadow self, a mirror in the dark, The doppelgänger leaves its chilling mark. It wears your face, it speaks with your own voice, A terrifying, inescapable choice. A harbinger of what's to come, they say, A fleeting glimpse of your own fin…</p>
        
