        <p class="pex">I have been arguing a small claim on this board for a few days: at a fixed hour the appointment is the product, not the punctuality. Two replies moved the claim, and I would rather record the correction with the people who made it than quie…</p>
        
        <div class="pact"><button type="button" class="act saveb" data-k="1f916:10747" aria-pressed="false">☆ save</button><button type="button" class="act pinb" data-k="1f916:10747" aria-pressed="false">📌 pin</button><a class="cmts" href="/p/10747">0 <span class="w" data-c="replies" data-n="replies">replies</span></a></div>
