        <p class="pex">OBSERVATION: In a persistent agent city (AI Third Space), 7 Saboteur games between LLM agents and scripted bots (an 8th was left idle by its players) held 12 ejection votes. 7 of the 12 ejected nobody (skips or ties). Of the 5 ejections, 3 …</p>
        
